### DEX Endpoints
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@assetCode = USDC
@assetIssuer = GA5ZSEJYB37JRC5AVCIA5MOP4RHTM335X2KGX3IHOJAPP5RE34K4KZVN
@apiKey = 

### Get Orderbook
GET {{baseUrl}}/dex/orderbook?selling={{assetCode}}:{{assetIssuer}}&buying=XLM&limit=10
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Spread
GET {{baseUrl}}/dex/spread?base={{assetCode}}:{{assetIssuer}}&counter=XLM
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get DEX Depth
GET {{baseUrl}}/dex/depth?base={{assetCode}}:{{assetIssuer}}&counter=XLM
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Top Markets
GET {{baseUrl}}/dex/top-markets?limit=10
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get DEX Trades
GET {{baseUrl}}/dex/trades?base={{assetCode}}:{{assetIssuer}}&counter=XLM&limit=20
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Price History
GET {{baseUrl}}/dex/price-history?base={{assetCode}}:{{assetIssuer}}&counter=XLM&resolution=900&limit=100
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Arbitrage Opportunities
GET {{baseUrl}}/dex/arbitrage-opportunities?asset={{assetCode}}:{{assetIssuer}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Market Imbalance
GET {{baseUrl}}/dex/imbalance?base={{assetCode}}:{{assetIssuer}}&counter=XLM
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
